Name:P8 - New Blood never cast (pattern 7, abilities with no AI)
Description:New Blood (gain control of target creature, then change its text) sits in four TFR legend decks (Clavileno, Florian, Garza Zol, Vito). Its ChangeText sub-ability has no AI (SpellApiToAi maps no class, so CannotPlayAi), and chkDrawbackWithSubs vetoes the whole spell. Here the AI has a Vampire to tap, four Swamps and New Blood; the opponent has a Serra Angel. Steal it.
